### BrahmanGan API - HTTP Testing File
### Usa esta archivo con extensiones como REST Client para VS Code

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@contentType = application/json

### =================================
### PRODUCTS ENDPOINTS
### =================================

### Get all products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

###

### Get product by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1

###

### Get active products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/active

###

### Get products in stock
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/in-stock

###

### Get products by price range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/price-range?minPrice=10&maxPrice=100

###

### Create new product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Test Product",
  "price": 99.99,
  "description": "This is a test product",
  "initialStock": 10
}

###

### Update product price
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1/price
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "newPrice": 149.99
}

###

### Add stock to product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1/stock/add
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "quantity": 5
}

###

### Remove stock from product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1/stock/remove
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "quantity": 3
}

###

### Deactivate product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1/deactivate

###

### Activate product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1/activate

###

### =================================
### CUSTOMERS ENDPOINTS
### =================================

### Get all customers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers

###

### Get customer by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/1

###

### Get active customers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/active

###

### Create new customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customers
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com"
}

###

### Update customer email
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/1/email
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "newEmail": "john.newemail@example.com"
}

###

### Deactivate customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/1/deactivate

###

### =================================
### ORDERS ENDPOINTS
### =================================

### Get all orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders

###

### Get order by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1

###

### Get orders by customer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/customer/1

###

### Get pending orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/pending

###

### Create new order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "customerId": 1
}

###

### Add item to order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/items
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

###

### Confirm order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/confirm

###

### Ship order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/ship

###

### Deliver order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/deliver

###

### Cancel order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/cancel

###
